  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Affordable Housing Project (LISP III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to improve significantly the living conditions of low and lower-middle income households by providing access to affordable and improved housing quality.
The project facilitates the access to affordable and decent housing totalling 4,000 units, which would benefit to approximately 16,000 people (3% of total population in Suriname). The main beneficiaries will be the bottom 40% of the population in Suriname.</narrative>
  </description>
